WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.710
In Genesis, an old
couple, Abram and Sarai,

2
00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:05.370
have no children.

3
00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:10.170
Then comes a promise: their
offspring will become a great nation.

4
00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:14.480
And a land as well: Canaan,
promised to their descendants.

5
00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:18.010
Jews still call him Abraham our father.

6
00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:21.450
God promised Abraham a land and a nation.

7
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.350
But what did Abraham have to do in return?

8
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.410
In this mission, you'll
trace the promises of land,

9
00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:31.010
offspring and blessing,
from Haran to Canaan.

10
00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:34.780
Then you'll sort Abraham's promises
from those God made to Noah,

11
00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:37.080
to Moses and to David.

12
00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:42.110
Your mission: find out what Abraham
had to do in return for God's promise.
